(version 1)

# U3 (AP62200, SOT-563): the package's pad-to-pad gap is 0.15 mm by design (0.5 mm pitch), which is below the
# Power net class clearance (0.3 mm) that +12V, SW and GND are in. For anything that touches U3's courtyard - its
# own pads and the copper that escapes from them - allow the JLCPCB-safe 0.15 mm. Everywhere else the net class
# still applies. (insideCourtyard did not match a track that leaves the courtyard, so the router refused to start.)
(rule "U3 fine pitch pads"
    (constraint clearance (min 0.15mm))
    (condition "A.intersectsCourtyard('U3') && B.intersectsCourtyard('U3')"))
